CDA Islamabad — Residential Construction Rules

Free illustrated reference guide + interactive plot design calculator for anyone planning,
designing, or approving a house in the Islamabad Capital Territory (ICT).

Built from the ICT Residential Sectors Zoning (Building Control) Regulations 2020
(S.R.O. 1575(I)/2019) — covered area, storeys, height, mumty, basement, setbacks, porch,
room sizes, housing units, extra/adjoining land, farmhouses, apartments, approvals and
penalties — consolidated into one practical, design-oriented resource.

